      "tags": [],
      "notes": "Compound name: adjective 'Improvised' from themeAdjectivePools['thorned-chassis'], Base noun 'Yoke' invented (a harness bolted on in a hurry, not from a pool). Capability atom.retribution (resource.delta, OnDamageTaken) reads as the makeshift rig shoving a hit straight back rather than absorbing it cleanly. Claims armament-primary only, no armament-secondary in this entry. All four member roles (armament-primary, core-guard, manipulator, footing) are in the hybrid role core. Higher tiers use only Flat/Increased stat.modify families (might, ferocity, vitality) - neither of the More-op families (bulwark, savagery) and no defense-channel family (warding, resilience), so SetTierForbiddenAtom does not apply."
