      "notes": "Whole-token fusion name 'Ironstem' from uniqueSetSeedPools['thorned-chassis'], used atomically. This partition's one grand (6-piece) set, per ssot-sets.md 3.4's 'exception, not the pattern' - it carries the mandatory thresholds at 2 and 4 plus a top threshold at 6, equal to its member count, so SetThresholdUnreachable does not apply. Capability atom.gardener (spawn.entity, OnDeath, plant) is powerBand medium rather than low, matching the grand-set convention already used on this fleet's frostbitten-vanguard sibling's own 6-piece entry - the six-slot commitment earns a stronger splash than a typical 4-piece set. Claims armament-secondary only, never armament-primary in the same entry. Six distinct member roles (armament-secondary, core-guard, head-guard, mantle, girdle, footing), all in the hybrid role core, none repeated within this entry. Tagged 'signature' (notability axis, tags.v1.json) as the partition's flagship - a curation flag, not a power claim. Higher tiers (vitality, fortitude, might, ferocity) are Flat/Increased stat.modify only, no More-op family."
